  "title": "Campfire Reubens",
  "description": "Classic Reuben sandwiches toasted over a campfire or on an outdoor grill acquire a special flavor. Make sandwiches with corned beef, Swiss cheese and sauerkraut, then seal them in foil packets, and cook until the bread toasts and cheese melts. Enjoy blissful bites!",
